  "details": "I would like to request a feature that allows for the creation of a movable voice source for avatars, similar to how the avatar’s viewpoint can be repositioned. This would enable users to change where their voice originates in real-time, either within their own avatar or in relation to other objects or avatars in the environment.\n\nThis feature would allow for more immersive and creative possibilities, such as:\n\n\t•\tSimulating voice projection from different parts of a multi-avatar setup (e.g., clones, or props).\n\n\t•\tCreating interactive experiences where the voice moves through the scene, such as ventriloquism, hidden characters, or scripted performances.\n\nIt would greatly enhance the ability to create custom, immersive experiences, particularly in role-playing or storytelling contexts.",
